"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
145,"Nasr bin Ali told us, Bishr bin Al-Mufaddal told us, Khaled Al-Hadha told us, on the authority of Abdullah bin Shaqiq, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace. May God bless him and grant him peace. He said: “If one of you wakes up from his sleep, he should not dip his hand into the vessel until he has washed it three times, for he does not know where it lay.” ""His hand."" Bishr bin Muadh informed us of this, so he conveyed the message and said: From its vessel."
